 "notes": "La France quadrangle map (MS-10, 1966) with text; Inner Piedmont, no stratigraphic ages beyond lead-alpha zircon ages suggesting early Paleozoic for the sequence (Overstreet et al., 1961). Relief 520-820 ft; Hartwell Reservoir levels are lake elevations, not geologic surfaces. Schematic section A-A' has no scale or holes, so not recorded. Strike/dip numbers have no printed coordinates. No drill holes. SUBSURFACE: none.",
